OL,5,G2100 Ceili House
OL,6,     FTonight, we're in Edwina Guckian's
OL,7,     Fhome in Co. Leitrim with the
OL,8,     FGralton Big Band and guests. This
OL,9,     FCeili house programme was first
OL,10,     Fbroadcast in April this year.
OL,11,G2200 Folk on One
OL,12,     FBroadcaster and singer Muireann
OL,13,     FNic Amhlaoibh brings us a golden
OL,14,     Fhour of folk music both old and
OL,15,     Fnew, acoustic and traditional from
OL,16,     Facross Ireland and beyond.
OL,17,G2300 Country Time
OL,18,     FThe best in country music
OL,19,     Fpresented by Brian Lally, who'll
OL,20,     Fdo his best to have something old,
OL,21,     Fsomething new, something borrowed
OL,22,     Fand something bluegrass.
